  'Troy Williams, a pioneering leader in the fields of private investigation, cybersecurity, and AI-driven fraud prevention. With over 32 years of experience, Troy has consistently demonstrated a rare combination of technical expertise, strategic vision, and a deep commitment to national security and digital integrity while furthering his academic background to stay current on relevant topics. As the founder of Cybersmarts.ai LLC, Troy has developed and launched multiple patent-pending technologies, including PatriotProof™, FraudDNA™, PPP™, and AISF™, each representing a leap forward in proactive fraud detection and cyber defense. These innovations are not only engineered to enforce zero-trust principles and post-quantum readiness, but they are also vital tools in protecting American citizens and institutions from increasingly sophisticated cyber threats. Troy''s academic and professional credentials are equally impressive and relevant with today''s changing times. With a PhD in Artificial Intelligence, he contributes to the scholarly community through ResearchGate, Google Scholar, and as a mentor at Western Governors University (WGU). His accolades include membership in the National Honor Society, the Sword and Shield Honor Society, and the prestigious WGU Capstone Excellence Award, highlighting both his intellectual rigor and commitment to excellence. Troy''s work is driven by a clear and unwavering mission: to defend the nation''s digital frontier and safeguard identities, assets, and sovereignty against foreign and domestic threats. His leadership, innovation, and dedication make him an invaluable asset to any organization or initiative focused on cybersecurity, AI, or fraud prevention. I offer my highest recommendation for Troy Williams and his continued contributions to America''s cybersecurity future.',
